rom the evil pirates  grip now that would be worth the wait  so do we have you convinced that Queen  Athena was given a small role in  Disney's Peter Pan if so let us know  which arguments made you a believer and  hey don't be shy and fill us in on some  little mermaid theories of your own who  knows you might be on to something and  that's it for our video don't forget to  subscribe to the things for all things  Disney to head your way thanks for  watching and see you next time  [Music]

